      "summary": "Evidence summary: 4 validated structured observations; consult observations and conflicts for supported findings.",
      "observations": [
        {
          "category": "mechanics",
          "statement": "The core experience is a physics-driven cinematic platformer built around momentum, teleportation and environmental interactions; players repeatedly praise how responsive and satisfying the movement feels when the systems click.",
          "sentiment": "positive",
          "recurrence": "moderate",
          "mention_count": 3,
          "evidence_languages": [
            "russian",
            "non_russian"
          ],
          "evidence_status": "durable",
          "source_ids": [
            "source-002",
            "source-003"
          ],
          "player_feedback_ids": [
            "feedback-001",
            "feedback-002",
            "feedback-003"
          ]
        },
        {
          "category": "repetition",
          "statement": "Level design introduces new environmental mechanics and visual situations often enough to keep most of the campaign varied, which several players identify as a major strength across its roughly ten-hour runtime.",
          "sentiment": "positive",
          "recurrence": "moderate",
          "mention_count": 3,
          "evidence_languages": [
            "russian",
            "non_russian"
          ],
          "evidence_status": "durable",
          "source_ids": [
            "source-002",
            "source-003"
          ],
          "player_feedback_ids": [
            "feedback-001",
            "feedback-003",
            "feedback-004"
          ]
        },
        {
          "category": "friction",
          "statement": "The main recurring frustration is unpredictability: some jumps, grabs, physics reactions and puzzle solutions do not always behave as players expect, and checkpoint placement can make failed attempts more annoying.",
          "sentiment": "negative",
          "recurrence": "moderate",
          "mention_count": 3,
          "evidence_languages": [
            "russian",
            "non_russian"
          ],
          "evidence_status": "durable",
          "source_ids": [
            "source-002",
            "source-003"
          ],
          "player_feedback_ids": [
            "feedback-001",
            "feedback-003",
            "feedback-005"
          ]
        },
        {
          "category": "other",
          "statement": "Atmosphere, pixel-art environments and sound design are frequently praised, while the narrative is commonly described as much thinner than the platforming and visual presentation.",
          "sentiment": "mixed",
          "recurrence": "limited",
          "mention_count": 2,
